Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 13:46:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] treble_app: add device spoofing for user apps

add a page with a switch and the device values user apps should see.
each value goes to persist.sys.spoof.<field>, which the framework
reads when a non system app starts. presets fill the form with android
17 values of real pixel, samsung and xiaomi devices.
